a vendor arm copied and compiled under the stand-ins is accepted, its fallback undemanded: true
a vendor arm copied by a copy_files glob into a default-module library is accepted: true
an arm gated on no vendor library is not demanded: true
an arm that only forbids a vendor library is not demanded: true
a vendor arm nothing copies is refused, naming its dune file: true
an arm gated on a vendor backend's public name alone is demanded: true
a copy of a same-named file from another directory does not count: true
a copy outside arrayjit/vendor_stubs does not count: true
a copied arm no library compiles is refused: true
a tree with no package stand-in is refused: true
a tree with no backend stand-in is refused: true
a dune file that does not read is refused: true
an empty dune-file corpus is refused: true

